rns 16, he sets out on a journey to slay the dragon, and Giruu accompanies him, having no choice. Along the way, they meet many types of people, and gain companions on their journey.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["聖戦ケルベロス 竜刻のファタリテ",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-40494":"2022-01-30T07:23:31Z","serial-7726":"2019-12-10T14:31:10Z","serial-7727":"2019-11-27T16:52:35Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-40494","serial-7726","serial-7727"],"relatedMalIds":[],"availableEpisodeCount":13,"rating":5.58}]}